---
layout: base.njk
title: "Categories"
lang: en
description: "The four quiet drawers of HD2Lab's Diary — Devlog, Architecture, Troubleshooting and Notes."
permalink: "/categories/index.html"
---

{% set categories = collections.diaryCategories %}
{% set posts = collections.diaryPosts %}

<section class="page-hero shell">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="{{ '/' | url }}">Diary</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Categories</span>
    </nav>
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Categories</p>
    <h1>Four quiet drawers.</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-lede">Thoughts settle by theme. Open a drawer to see everything kept inside it.</p>
    <div class="page-hero-meta">
        <span class="badge">{{ categories | length }} categories</span>
        <span class="badge">{{ posts | length }} post{% if posts | length != 1 %}s{% endif %}</span>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="categories shell" aria-labelledby="categories-all-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">All drawers</p>
            <h2 id="categories-all-title">Every drawer.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Things made, things designed, things broken, things jotted down.</p>
    </div>
    <nav class="category-grid" aria-label="Diary categories">
        {% for category in categories %}
        <a class="category-card" href="{{ ('/categories/' + category.slug + '/') | url }}">
            <span class="card-index">{{ category.index }} / {{ category.name | upper }}</span>
            <span class="category-name">{{ category.name }}</span>
            <span class="category-blurb">{{ category.blurbEn or category.blurb or 'A small collection on this theme.' }}</span>
            <span class="category-foot">
                <span class="category-count">{{ category.count }} post{% if category.count != 1 %}s{% endif %}</span>
                <span class="category-latest">{% if category.latest %}Latest {{ category.latest | relativeDate('en') }}{% else %}No notes yet{% endif %}</span>
            </span>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
    </nav>
</section>

<section class="cta-band shell">
    <div>
        <h2>Every drawer,<br><span>all at once.</span></h2>
        <p>Recent notes stay on the Diary home; the things I build live on Web-HQ.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button button-primary" href="{{ '/' | url }}">Back to the Diary home <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
</section>
